---
title: Opening hours
summary: When the welcome center and the library are open.
order: 3
---

The welcome center is open all year, except on public holidays.

| Day | Hours |
|---|---|
| Monday to Friday | 9 am to 5 pm |
| Saturday | 10 am to 2 pm |
| Sunday | Closed |

Holidays are listed as a Markdoc table.

{% table %}
* Holiday
* Hours
---
* New Year's Day
* Closed
{% /table %}

{% if $product.beta %}
| Service | Where |
|---|---|
| Campus tours | The {% abbr title="welcome center" %}WC{% /abbr %} |
{% /if %}

The library keeps longer hours.

| Building | Hours |
|---|---|
| Library | 8 am to 10 pm<br>Weekends 10 am to 6 pm |

Ask at the welcome desk about anything else.
